    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Loc nath gɔɔyä ciɛŋä kɛ kɔr däkä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu riet Kuɔth Nhial rɔ nyɔk kɛ ben kä Yir-mɛ-yaa mëë ŋotdɛ tëë yieenä rɛy rɛ̈ɛ̈k duëël yiëëni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cu Kuoth Nhial in cak ɣɔw, kä min yiɛth jɛ piny min cɔalkɛ ciötdɛ i̱ Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Cɔl ɣä bä ji̱ loc, kä bä ji̱ nyuɔ̱th ti di̱t ti ŋuan ti /ci ŋäc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial min la Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl nɛmɛ lar kɛ kui̱ ciëëŋni wec ɛmɛ, kɛnɛ dho̱r kua̱ri Juda ɛn ɣöö ba kɛ da̱k piny kɛ ɣöö ba kɛ lät ni päny mi ba gaŋ ni rɔ̱ kä nɛy tin ca ko̱o̱tni la̱t tin ca go̱l wec kɛ ko̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ko̱run kɛ ji̱ Kɛ̈l-da-ya, ba thieŋ ni ti̱ec ti̱ti̱ kɛ pua̱ny nɛɛni tin ci li̱w, nɛy tin bä näk kɛ ŋɛ̈ɛ̈nydä, kɛ ɣöö cä wec ɛmɛ lo̱k kɛ kui̱ dueeri tin ci kɛn kɛ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛnɛ ɣän bä kɛ nöŋ gɔɔy kɛnɛ pual pua̱a̱ny. Kä bä kɛ nyuɔ̱th ria̱ŋ mi di̱i̱t kɛnɛ mal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän bä Juda kɛnɛ I-thɛ-rɛl luɔ̱c gɔɔy ciɛŋädiɛn ce̱tnikɛ ta̱a̱diɛn ëë wal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bä dueerkiɛn tëë ci kɛn kɛ lät kä ɣä päl. Kä bä duer ëë ci kɛn ɛ dui̱r kɛ lo̱kdiɛn kɛ ɣä päl bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä wec ɛmɛ bɛ la gua̱a̱th tɛthkä lɔaac, kä ba gua̱a̱th liakä, kä ba gua̱a̱th puɔnyä kä ɣä nhiam dööri diaal wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n, tin ba gɔy tin cä la̱t kɛ kui̱diɛn liŋ. Kä bikɛ tekɛ dual kɛnɛ riɛk mi wa tin gɔw kɛnɛ ria̱ŋ in di̱i̱t in cä ka̱m kɛ jek.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial mɛmɛ laar wëë i̱, “Ɛn gua̱a̱th ɛmɛ ɛ ca larɛ i̱, ‘Ca päl ɛ thilɛ raan kɛnɛ leyɛ,’ wi̱i̱ Juda kɛnɛ rɛy duɔ̱pni Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm tin ca ba̱ny piny a thilɛ raan kä thilɛ ley mi cieŋ thi̱n ɛ ba jɔw nyɔk kɛ lieŋ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɔw tɛthkä lɔaac, kɛ nɛy ti köök kɛ kuën kɛ jɔw nɛɛni ti ki̱t kɛ diit tɛthkä lɔaac ti nööŋ kɛ muc rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial wä kɛ i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä mɛmɛ larɛ Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa i̱, ‘Rɛy muɔ̱ɔ̱n ɛmɛ ca ba̱ny piny a thil raan kɛnɛ ley ɛ, kɛ wi̱i̱kɛ diaal ɛ bɛ lɛ ni tekɛ naath ti bi cieŋ thi̱n ti yiënkɛ detkiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rɛy wi̱i̱ni pa̱a̱m, kɛ rɛy wi̱i̱ni Cɛ-pe-laa, kɛ wec Nɛ-gɛb, kɛ rɛy rööl Ben-ya-min kɛ gua̱th tin thieek kɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, amäni rɛy wi̱i̱ni Juda, bi det loc ni tetni nɛɛni tëë la ciaŋkɛ kɛ.’ Ruac ni ɣän Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaar mi gɔaa kɛnɛ mat ruac kɛ Dee-bid",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä nɛnɛ ni̱n a bëëni tin bä jakni ruac ëë la̱rä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kɛnɛ ji̱ Juda jak kä thuɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɛn ni̱n ti̱ti̱ kɛ jɛn gua̱a̱th ɛ mɔ, bä kuäär mi gɔaa jakä jɔc kä kar Dee-bid. Kä bɛ cuŋ kɛnɛ thuɔ̱ɔ̱k nyoth ɛn muun ɛmɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn ni̱ni ti̱ti̱ bi Juda luäk jek kä bi Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm cieŋ kɛ mal. Kä mɛmɛ ba jɛn ciöt in ba cɔɔl ni jɛ i̱, ‘Kuoth Nhial ɛ jɛn cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋda.’ Ruac ni ɣän Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial mɛmɛ lar wëë i̱, “Kä thok duëël Dee-bid /cɛ bi met thil ram mi nyuur wi̱i̱ kɔam kuäärä I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ci ji̱ Lii-bay bi met thil ram mi tho̱p muc tin waŋkɛ kɛnɛ muc bɛɛl nhiamdä amäni cäŋ kɛl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu riet Kuɔth Nhial ben kä Yir-mɛ-yaa wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mi wi̱i̱ mat ruacdä wä däk kɔnɛ cäŋdäär kɛnɛ wäär ɛ /ci cäŋdäär kɛnɛ wäär bi ben kɛ gua̱a̱th in la bä kɛ kɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inɔ bä, bi mat ruacdä kɛ ja̱ŋdä ni Dee-bid cu da̱k bä. Kä /cɛ bi /cɛ tekɛ gat mi bi nyuur wi̱i̱ kɔam kuäärädɛ kä bɛ cu tey inɔ bä kɛ kui̱c ji̱ Lii-bay tin la bööth palä tin la̱t kɛ ɣä ikä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ce̱tnikɛ min /ca ciɛr Nhial dee luäŋ kɛ kuën kä /ca nyin litdä bäpdiit dee luäŋ kɛ kuën, kä ɛnɛ bä ɣän bä kar jäŋädä ni Dee-bid jakä rëpkɛ rɔ̱ amäni ji̱ Lii-bay tin la bööth palä tin la̱t kɛ ɣä ikä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
